/*
 * Declares the MathFloatOperatorValue class.
 *
 * MathFloatOperatorValue represents binary arithmetic operations applied to two
 * floating-point operands. These operations follow IEEE-754 semantics,
 * including rounding behavior, precision constraints, and NaN propagation
 * rules. The result type is a floating-point type provided at construction.
 *
 * Supported operations typically include:
 *   - addition,
 *   - subtraction,
 *   - multiplication,
 *   - division
 *   - etc.
 *
 * <hr>
 * 
 * @Package: ymirc        
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::generator::value::operator::binary::float_::math
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/generator/value/operator/binary/float_/math.yr
